From c684c8713efa8d9cbf85112293e695b4d3bb2497 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 06:39:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 18/28] test: declare feature, interface, mempool and mining
 test parameters as class attributes

Applies contrib/devtools/declarative-test-params.py to the feature_*,
interface_*, mempool_* and mining_* tests: 62 of 64 converted.
feature_assumeutxo.py and feature_block.py compute parameters at
runtime and keep set_test_params().

Every converted module imports, and the full functional suite gives the
same per-test results as before.
